OL,3,GNEWSARyanair offered #67m grant for NI
OL,4,Aengine facility
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior Stormont official has
OL,7,Fconfirmed that Ryanair will be offered
OL,8,Fa #67m subsidy to locate an engine
OL,9,Fmaintenance facility in Northern
OL,10,FIreland.
OL,12,FIt is thought the facility would create
OL,13,Fup to 600 jobs.
OL,15,FIan Snowden, the top official in the
OL,16,FDepartment for the Economy, told MLAs
OL,17,Fit would be "the biggest inward
OL,18,Finvestment for two decades".
OL,20,FHe said that the bulk of the grant
OL,21,Fwould come from the NI Enhanced
OL,22,FInvestment Zone (EIZ).
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
